NAME
    rumiai-os - activate the branded RumiAI shell environment

SYNOPSIS
    rumiai-os [<shell-argument> ...]

DESCRIPTION
    rumiai-os is the current shell-oriented branded root entrypoint.

    When invoked outside an initialized m runtime it resolves its installation
    root and re-enters through the technical m bootstrap. Inside m it prepends
    the branded ai-osarch and ai command directories to PATH and starts the
    managed shell facility. Arguments are forwarded to that shell.

    This current shell-oriented entrypoint does not define the eventual RumiAI
    graphical interface architecture.

EXIT STATUS
    On success the entrypoint transfers control to the managed shell.
    Non-zero status indicates bootstrap, activation or shell startup failure.

SEE ALSO
